<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">Hosea</book>
  <para style="h">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hosea</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hosea</para>
  <para style="mt">Hosea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda-ho lal Uzia te, Jothama te, Ahaza te, Hezekia te lal lai leh Israel-ho lal Jeroboama, Joasa fapa lal laia Beeria fapa Hosea hnêna Lalpa thu lo thleng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan Hosea hminga Israel-te hnêna thu a sawi ṭan lai khân hetiangin Hosea hnênah a sawi: “Kal la, nupuiah nawhchizuar nei la, nawhchizuar lakah fa hring rawh; hetiang hian ka mite chuan mi kalsan a, mi uirêsan ta a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, a kal a, Diblaima fanu Gomeri chu a nei ta a; tin, nau a pai a, fapa a hrinsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “A hmingah Jezreela sa rawh; rei rial lovin Jezreel thisen phuba chu Jehua chhûngte chungah ka la ang a, Israela chhûngte ram chu ka tikin ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Jezreel ruamah Israel-ho thal ngul chu ka titliak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, nau a pai leh a, fanu a hring a. Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “A hmingah Lo-ruhamai sa rawh; Israela chhûngte chu ka lainat ngai dâwn tawh lo, ka ngaidam ṭhuai dâwn tawh si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Juda chhûngte erawh chu ka lainat ang a, thal ngul emaw, khandaih emaw, indona emaw, sakawr emaw, sakawr chung chuang mi emawa anmahni chhandam lovin, Lalpa an Pathian chuan ka chhandam ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lo-ruhamai chu hnute hnêk a bântîr a; tin, nau a pai leh a, fapa a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a: “A hmingah Lo-ammia sa rawh: nangni hi ka mite in ni si lo va; tin, kei hi in Pathian ka ni dâwn lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Israel fate chu tuifinriat ṭiau vaivut, teh rual loh leh chhiar rual loh zât an ni ang a; tin, heti hi a ni ang a, an hnêna, “Ka mite in ni lo,” tihna hmunah chuan, “Pathian nung fate in ni e,” tih a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Juda fate leh Israel fate chu an pung khâwm ang a, an lû tûr an ruat ang a, chu ram aṭang chuan an kal chho vang; Jezreel ni chu a ropui dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In unaupate hnênah chuan, “Ammia,” ti ula, in farnute hnênah chuan, “Ruhamai,” ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“In nu hi bei rawh u, bei rawh u; Ani hi ka nupui a ni si lo va, Kei pawh a pasal ka ni lo! A hmêl ata a nawhchizawrh chîn hi paih thla sela, A ṭânglai ata a uire chîn hi paih thla rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuti lo chuan, ka tisaruak ang a, A pian nia a awm angin ka awmtîr ang a, Thlalêr angin ka siam ang a, Ram ro angin ka awmtîr ang a, Tuihâlin ka tihlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fate pawh ka lainat lo vang, Nawhchizuar fate an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An nu chuan nawhchi a zuar ṭhîn a, Anmahni paitu chu zahpuiawm takin a awm. ‘Ka chaw te, ka tui te, ka sahmul te, Ka la te, ka hriak te leh ka in tûr te mi petu, Ka ngaihzâwngte ka ûm ang,’ a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai teh, i kawng chu hlîngin ka ping ang a, Amah dâlin dai ka theu vang a, A kawngte a hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a ngaihzâwngte chu a ûm ang a, a ûm phâk lo vang; Anmahni a zawng ang a, a hmu lo vang; Tichuan, ‘Ka pasal hmasa hnênah ka kîr teh ang, Tûn ai hian hmân kha ka tân a ṭha zâwk si,’ a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Buh te, uain thar te, hriak te, Tangkarua ka tihpunsak te hi, Rangkachak, Baala tâna an hman te nên, Keima pêk a ni tih a hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka buh chu a seng hunah, Ka uain pawh chu a sâwr hunah ka la kîr leh ang, Ka sahmul leh ka la, a saruak khuhna tûr chu ka lâksak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, a ngaihzâwngte mit hmuhah A saruak zahmawh ka tilang ang, Ka kut ata tu mân an chhan chhuak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hlimna zawng zawng, a kût te, a thla thar te, A Chawlhnite leh a puipun hun zawng zawngte Ka tireh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A grêp hrui leh a theipui kûng, ‘Hêng hi ka ngaihzâwngte pêk ka hlawh chu a ni,’ A tih ṭhinate chu ka tiram ang. Ramhnuaiah ka siam ang a, ramsaten an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rimtui a hâlsak ṭhin Baala nite chu A chungah ka thungrûl ang. Chûng lai chuan a bengbehte leh a incheimawinate a inbel a, A ngaihzâwngte a pan a, kei mi theihnghilh a ni,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvângin, ngai teh, ka thlêm ang a, thlalêrah ka hruai ang a, Ngaihawm takin amah ka bia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, chuta chinah chuan a grêp huante chu a hnênah ka pe ang, Akor ruam pawh beiseina kawngka atân; Chutah chuan a tleirâwl lai nite leh Aigupta ram aṭanga a lo chhuah ni ang khân A chhâng ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chua heti hian a ti: “Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang, ‘Ishi’ mi ti ang a, ‘Baali’ mi ti tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ka ata Baala hmingte hi ka tihbosak dâwn si a, An hming hi lam a ni rêng rêng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan ramsate, chunglêng savate, Leia rannungte nêna thuthlung an tân ka siam ang a; Thal ngul te, khandaih te, indona te hi, Lei ata ka tiboral ang a, him takin ka awm hotîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumkhuain ka tân ka hual tlat ang che; Felna te, rorêlna te, khawngaihna te, lainatna tein, Ka tân ka hual ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rinawmnain ka tân ka hual ang che; Tichuan, Lalpa chu in hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Ka bia ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Vânte ka bia ang a; tin, annin lei an bia ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, lei chuan buh te, uain thar te, hriak te a bia ang; Tin, annin Jezreel an bia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ani chu ka tân leiah ka chîng ang a; Lainatdawnglovi chu ka lainat ang a, Kaminilova chu, ‘Ka mi i ni,’ ka ti ang a, Tin, anin, ‘Ka Pathian i ni!’ a ti ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Kal leh ta la, hmeichhia, mi dang duh lai, uirenu chu va hmangaih rawh, Israela thlahte chu pathian dang hnên lam hawiin grêp chhang ngaina mah se, Lalpan a hmangaih reng ang bawk hian,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, tangkaraw sâwm leh panga leh barli homer khat leh homer chanvein amah chu ka lei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a hnênah, “Ni tam tak chhûng chu ka tân i awm tûr a ni; nawhchi i zuar tûr a ni lo va, tu ma nupui i ni tûr a ni lo. Chutiang bawk chuan kei pawh i lakah ka awm ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israela thlahte chu ni tam tak lalber leh mi lian leh lungphun serh leh puithiam kawr emaw, milimte emaw nei lovin an awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan Israela thlahte chu an inlamlêt ang a, Lalpa an Pathian leh an lalber Davida chu an zawng ang a; ni hnuhnûngahte chuan Lalpa leh a ṭhatna chu khûr chungin an pan ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israela thlahte u, Lalpa thu chu ngaithla teh u; Lalpa chuan ram luahtute beihna tûr a nei si a: “He ramah hian thutak leh khawngaihna leh Pathian hriatna a awm lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhechham te, inbum te, inthah te, rûkrûk te, Uirê chîn te a punlun a, thisen a inphaman reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, ram chuan a sûn ang a, A chhûnga chêng tinrêng an chau vang, Ramsate, chunglêng savate nên; A ni, tuifinriata sanghate chenin lâk bo an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu mah inbei suh sela, Tu mah inzilhhau hek suh se; I mite chu puithiam beitute ang an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhûnah i tlu ang a, nangmah nên zâwlnei pawh zânah a tlu ang a; I nu pawh ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka mite chu hriatna tlâkchham avângin tihboral an ni a, Hriatna i hnar avângin kei pawhin ka puithiam i nihna ata ka hnar tawh ang che. I Pathian dân i theihnghilh vei a, Kei pawh hian i fate ka theihnghilh ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An pun poh leh ka chungah an sual tulh tulh vei a, An ropuina chu mualphonaah ka chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite sualna azârah an intihausa a, An khawlohnaah chuan an thinlung an nghat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mipui a puithiamin angkhata hrem an ni ang a, An kawngte avâng chuan anmahni ka hrem ang a, An thiltihte ka thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An ei tak nâng a, an tlai si lo vang; Nawhchizawrh an chîng nâng a, an pung lo vang, Lalpa pawisakna an neih loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nawhchizawrh te, uain te, uain tharte chuan Thinlung a la bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka mite chuan an thing milimte an râwn a, An tiang chuan a hrilh ṭhîn; Nawhchizawrhna rilru chuan a hruai bo va, An Pathian lak ata an hur bo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlâng chhîpahte chuan an inthawi a, Mualahte chuan rimtui an hâl a, Sasua leh beraw leh hlai hnuaiahte chuan - A hlim a nawm avângin; Chuvângin, in fanute chuan nawhchizawrh an chîng a. In famote chuan uire an chîng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In fanuten nawhchi an zawrha, In famote an uirein ka hrem lo vang: Anmahni ngei pawh nawhchizuarte nên an kal hrang a, Maichâm nawhchizuarte nên an inthawi ho si a; Hre thiam lo mipuite chu an tluchhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Israel, nang chuan nawhchizawrh chîng ta mah la, Juda zawngin chîng ve lul suh se. Gilgal-ah lo kal suh ula, Beth-aven-ah chho hek suh ula, ‘ Lalpa a nun chhûng chu,’ tiin chhia chham hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bâwngla luhlul ang maiin Israel-ho chu an luhlul a; Tûnah chuan Lalpan berâmno angin phûlah a châwm thei ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephraima chuan milem a zawmpui ta a, A awm awmin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An zu in chu an ṭiak a, an inphalrai ta ṭhîn a; A rorêltute chuan thil zahpuiawm tih an ngaina êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thliin a lâk hunah an inthawinate avângin an la zak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Aw nangni puithiamte u, hei hi hria ula, Nangni Israel chhûngte u, ngaithla ula, Aw lalber chhûngte u, beng chhi rawh u! Rorêlna chu in tân a ni si a; Mizpah-a thang leh Tabor t lânga lên zâr in nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi helte chuan tihhlum an uar êm êm a, Kei erawh chu an vaia zilhhautu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ephraima ka hria a, Israel chu ka lakah thup a ni lo; Tûnah hian aw Ephraim, nawhchizawrh i chîn avângin Israel chu tihbawrhbân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An Pathian lama hawi kîr tûrin An thiltih ṭhinte chu an bânsan lo va, Nawhchizawrh rilru an zîngah a awm si a, Lalpa chu an hre lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel chhuantawlawl chuan a hmai chhanah a hriattîr a, Chutichuan, Israel leh Ephraim chu an khawlohnaah an tlu ang a, Juda pawh an hnênah a tlu ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An berâm rualte leh an sebâwng rualte nên Lalpa zawng tûrin an kal ang a; Nimahsela, ani chu an hmu lo vang; An lak aṭangin a inla fihlîm tawh a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chungah vervêk takin an ti a ni, Hnam dang fate an hring si a. Thla thar chuan an lote nên lama boralna a thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibea khuaah tawtawrâwt tum ula, Rama khuaah berâmpa kî hâm rawh u; Beth-aven-ah au tuar tuar rawh u, ‘Aw Benjamin, i hnung lam kha!’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim chu hremna nîah chuan tihṭiau a ni ang; Thil lo ni ngei tûr chu Israel chite zîngah ka hriattîr tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Juda mi liante chu ramri sawntute ang an ni a: An chungah ka thinurna chu tuiangin ka leih bua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim chuan rah beh a chîng a, Dikna a palzût a, eng mah lo a ûm ruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, Ephraim tân chuan sûlrûl ang ka ni a, Juda chhûngkaw tân chuan mawihna ang ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ephraim chuan a natna a hmu a, Juda chuan a hliam a hmu a. Tah chuan Ephraim chu Assuria hnênah a kal a, Lalber Jareba hnênah chuan mi a tîr a; Nimahsela, ani chuan a tidam thei lo che u a, In hliam chu a tihdamsak thei hek lo che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraim tân chuan sakeibaknei ang, Juda tân chuan sakeibaknei vânglai ang ka ni dâwn si a; Keimah, keimah ngeiin ka hai thlêr ang a, Ka kal ang a, ka kal bopui ang a, Chhan chhuaktu tu mah an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An thiam lohna an inhriat hun hunah ka hmunah ka kîr ang a; Tichuan, ka hmêl an zawng an a, An tuarnaah chuan min zawng ruai ruai dâwn a ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hawh u, Lalpa hnênah i kîr ang u; Min lo pawt sawm tawh na a, min tidam leh dâwn si a; Min lo vaw tawh na a, min tuam leh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni hnih chinah min tinung ang a; Ni thum nîah min kai tho vang a, a hmaah kan awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa hriatna chu i ûm zêl ang khai, i hria ang u; Zîng anga khêl lovin a thawk chhuak ngei ṭhîn a ni: Kan hnênah ruah angin, ruah hnuhnûng, lei tihuhtu ang maiin a lo thleng ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Aw Ephraim, engtin nge ka tih ang che? Aw Juda, engtin nge ka tih ang che? Min hmangaihna chu zîng ṭiauchhûm leh dai ral ta thuai ṭhîn ang hi a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, zâwlneite hmangin anmahni ka râwt a, Ka kâa thutein anmahni ka tihlum a ni; I chunga ka rorêlnate chu i tân kâwlphe êng zuai zuai ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inthawina duh lovin khawngaihna ka duh si a; Hâlral thilhlante ai chuan Pathian hriatna ka duh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Adama angin thuthlung chu an bawhchhia a, Chutah chuan vervêk takin ka chungah an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead chu khawlohna titute khawpui a ni a, Thisen a kai pheng phung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Suam hmang rualin mi an châng ṭhîn angin, Puithiam pâwlte chuan Sekem kawngah mi an that ṭhîn; A ni, thil sual an ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israela chhûngkuaah chuan thil râpthlâk tak ka hmu, Ephraim-ah chuan nawhchizawrhna a awm a, Israel chu a bawrhbâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mite chu an sal tânna ata ka hruai kîr hunah chuan, Aw Juda, i tân pawh rah seng tûr ruat a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel tihdam ka tumin Ephraim khawlohna a lo lang a, Samari suahsualna nên. Bum an chîng a, Chhûng lamah rûkru a lo lût a, Pâwn lamah suamhmang rualin an suam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An suahsualna zawng zawng ka hre reng tih An thinlungin an ngaihtuah lo; Tûnah chuan an thiltihte ngeiin a chîm vêl tlat tawh a. Ka hmai hmaah an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An suahsualnain lalbe a tilâwm a, An dâwt thuin mi liante an tilâwm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An vaiin uire an ni a; Chhang siamtuin thuk a ur lum, Chhangphut a hmeh diak a thawh hmaa, Mei chhawm a chawlhsan rih ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan lalber nîah chuan mi liante chu uain rû takin an intirui a; Ani chuan hmusittute rualin a kut a phar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A rûka an chân laiin an thinlung chu thuk ang maiin an siam tawh si a; An thinur chu zankhuain a dai a, Zîngah chuan mei alh angin a alh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuk ang maiin an sa vek a, an rorêltute an tiboral a; An lalber apiangte chu an tlu a, An zîngah tu mah mi au an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim lah chu hnam dangte zîngah a intelh a; Ephraim chu chhang leh loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mikhualte chuan a chakna an ei zawhsak a, Ani chuan a hre lo. Hmul ṭuakin a bâwm nual tawh a, Ani chuan a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel ropuina chuan a hmai hmaah a hriattîr ṭhîn a; Nimahsela, hêng zawng zawngah pawh hian Lalpa an Pathian lam chu an hawi lo va, Ani chu an zawng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim chu ṭhuro lungmâwl, hriat thiamna nei lo ang a lo ni a; Aigupta lam an au thûl a, Assuria lamah an kal thûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kal laiin an chungah ka lên ka vawrh ang a, Chunglêng sava manin ka man ang a, An inkhâwmhovin an hriat tawh angin anmahni ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hnên ata an kal bo tâk avângin an chung a pik e! Ka chungah an hel tâk avângin An chungah boralna a thleng e! Kei chuan ka chhandam duh a, Anni erawh chuan dâwt mi sawi khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An thinlung takin mi au lo va, An khum laizâwlah an chiau mai mai zâwk a ni. Buh leh uain thar atân an inkhâwm a, ka chungah chuan an hel si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei chuan ka hruai chhuak a, ka tichak a; Mahse, ka chungah thil ṭha lo an suangtuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hawi kîr a, Chungnungbera hnênah ni lovin; Thal ngul rul ang an ni a. An mi liante chu an ṭawng chaltlai avângin khandaihin an tlu ang. Hei hi Aigupta rama nuihzatbûr an nihna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tawtawrâwt chu i hmuiah chuktuah rawh. Lalpa chhûngte chungah mupui angin a lo kal e, Ka thuthlung an bawhchhiata, Ka dân an helsan avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Ka Pathian, keini Israel-ho chuan kan hria a che,’ Tiin ka hnênah an au vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-ho chuan thil ṭha an hnâwl a, Hmêlmaten an ûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tih ni lovin lal an siam a; Ka hriat lohvin hotute an siam a; An boralna tûrin an tangkarua leh rangkachakin milim an insiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Samaria, i sebâwngno lim chu a hnâwl e! An chungah ka thinur êm êm a ni. Eng tikah tak thianghlim leh ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel themthiamte milem siam chu, Pathian a ni lo. A ni, Samaria sebâwngno lim chu tihkeh sawm vek a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thli an chîng a, thli chhia an seng dâwn si a. Kûng ding a nei lo va, zîk chuan rah a chhuah lo vang; Chhuah pawh ni sela, mikhualten an ei zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-ho chu lem zawhin an awm a ni; Bêl, a chhûnga lâwmna awm lo angin tûnah hian hnam dang zîngah an awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram sabengtung mal tla angin Assuria ramah an chho si a; Ephraim chuan ngaihzâwngte a tlawn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni, hnam dangte tlawn ruai mah se, Ka khâwm ang a, Lal leh hotu hriak an thih ṭhin ka tihbânsak rih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim chuan maichâm a tipung hi an thiltih sualna lek a ni a, An tân maichâm rêng rêng chu sualna mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka dân chu ka ziaksak rei rui a; Mahse, thil dang takah an ngai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tâna thilhlan inthawinate zawng! Sa an hlân a, an ei a; chûng chu Lalpan a pawm lo. Tichuan, an khawlohna a hre reng a, an sual a hrem a, Anni chu Aigupta ramah an kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel chuan a Siamtu a theihnghilh a, In ropuite a sa a; Juda chuan khawpui kulhte a tipung a; Mahse, a khawpuiahte chuan mei ka tîr ang a, A in ropuite chu a kâng zo vang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, hnam dangte angin hlim so bûng bûng khawpin lâwm suh; I Pathian chu nawhchi i zawrhsan a, Hruih zâwl tina a man chu i ngaina si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hruih leh grêp sâwrna khurte chuan anmahni a titlai lo vang a, Uain thar tûr a hlawhchham ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa ramah chuan an chêng lo vang a, Ephraim chu Aigupta lamah a kîr zâwk ang a, Assuria ramah chaw thiang lo an ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah uain chu an bun chhuak lo vang a, An thilhlante chu a tân lâwmawm a ni hek lo vang; An chhang chu lusûnte chaw ang a ni ang a, A ei apiang an bawrhbâng ang; An chhang chu an nunna atân mai a ni ang a, Lalpa inah a lo lût lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inkhâwmpui urhsûn nîah leh Lalpa kût nîah chuan Eng nge in tih tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh u, chhiatna a lo thleng ang a, an darh ang a, Aigupta chuan anni chu a lo khâwm zâwk ang a, Memphis chuan a lo phûm ang. An tangkaraw thil duhawmte chu kângṭhaiin a bâwm ang a, An puan inahte chuan hnimhlîngnei a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hremna nite chu a lo thleng a, Thungrulhna nite chu a lo thleng e; Israel chuan chu chu a hria ang! I khawlohna chu a tamin intaina chu a nasat avângin, Zâwlnei chu a â a, thlarau nei mi chu mi â a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraim râlvêngtu chu ka Pathian hnêna awm a ni a; Zâwlnei lah chu a kawng tluanin thangkamtu thang a awm a, A Pathian inah pawh intaina a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibea khuaa awm lai nite ang khân Nasa takin anmahni an intikhawlo va. An khawlohna chu a hre reng ang a, An sualnate chu a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel chu thlalêra grêp rah ang maiin ka hmu a. In pate chu theipui, hun hmasaa a hmin hmasa angin ka hmu; Mahse, anni chu Baal-peor hmunah an lo kal a, Thil zahthlâk takah chuan an inpumpêk ta a, An ngainat tak milemte ang bawk chuan an tenawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ephraim lah chu, an ropuina chu sava angin a thlâwk bo vang a: Nau hring te, nau pai te, rai te an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An fate puitlin mah sela mipa rêng rêng awm lo tûrin Ka sûntîr tho vang. A ni, anmahni ka hawisan hunah chuan An chung a va pik zual dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tura ka hmuh ang bawkin Ephraima chu hmun nuam taka dahin a awm a: Mahse, Ephraima chuan a fate chu thattu hnênah a la hruai chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , neihtîr rawh: Eng nge i neihtîr ang le? Chhûl nau chhiat ṭhîn leh hnute vuaite chu neihtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An suahsualna zawng zawng chu Gilgal-ah an ti ṭan a, Chutah chuan anni chu ka haw si a. An thiltih suaksual avângte chuan ka in ata ka hnawt chhuak ang; Anniho hi ka hmangaih tawh lo vang. An hotu zawng zawngte chu hel hmang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ephraim chu vuakin a awm a, an zung chu a ro zo va; Rah an chhuah lo vang. A ni, chhuah mah sela, an chhûl rah duhawm tak chu Ka that tho tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pathian chuan anni chu a paih bo vang, Amah an bengkhawn loh avângin; Tichuan, hnam dangte zînga vâkvaiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel chu grêp hrui duah tak, rah ngah tak a ni. A rah tam hu ang zêlin a maichâmte a tipung a; A ram ṭhatzia ang zêlin lungserh phun ṭha tak a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rilru pahnih an nei a, Tûnah chuan thiam loh changin an awm tawh ang. An maichâmte chu Lalpan a vaw chim ang a, An lungserh phunte chu a tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Lal tak tak kan nei lo ve, Lalpa chu kan ṭih si lo va. Chu lal chuan eng nge min tihsak theih ang?” tiin, Tûnah chuan an sawi tawh ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuthlung an siamna lamah dâwta chhechhamin Thu lawi lo an sawi a. Chuvângin, leileh dûra hnim tûr nei a ṭo angin, Rorêlna a pung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samari rama chêngte chu Beth-aven sebâwngno avâng chuan thlaphângin an awm ang. A lak ata a bo tâk avângin chuta mite chu an lungngai ang a, Chumia puithiamho a ropuina chunga la lâwm ṭhînte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah ngei pawh chu Lal Jareba hnêna pêk tûrin Assuria ramah kal bopui a ni ang. Ephraima chuan zah a hmu ang a, Israel chuan ama thurawt ngei chu a zahpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samari ram lah chu, tui chunga thing ṭang nawi ang mai hian A lal chu tihboral a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel sualna Aven hmun sângte pawh chu tihchhiat a ni ang. An maichâmahte chuan hlîng leh hnimhlîngnei a lo ṭo vang a; Tlâng hnênahte chuan, “Min khuh rawh,” an ti ang a, Mual hnênahte chuan, “Min delh rawh,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aw Israel, Gibea ni aṭang tawh khân i sual a ni; Chutah in la chhunzawm a. Khawlohna fate chunga dona chuan Gibea ngeiah chuan a ûm phâk hlawm lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka duh hunah chuan anmahni ka hrîng ang a; Tin, an bawhchhiat thuah hnih avânga hrem an nih hunah chuan, An chungah mipuite chu an pung khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Ephraima chu bâwngla zirtîr tawh, Buh chîl châk tak a ni a; Mahse, kei ngei hian a nghâwng mawi takah chuan Nghâwngkawl ka bahtîr tawh ang a, Ephraima chungah mi ka chuantîr ang a, Juda pawh chuan lei a let ang a, Jakoba chuan a lei tlangte chu a tisawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahni tân felna tuh ula, Khawngaihna seng rawh u; In lei khêkte let rawh u, Lalpa zawn hun a ni si a, A lo kala malsâwmna a vûr hma che u chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, suahsualna in tuh a, Khawlohna in seng a: In dâwt sawi rah in nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan i mite zîngah buai mum mumna a lo chhuak ang a, Salmana chuan indo nia Beth- arbel a tihchhiat ang khân, I kulh zawng zawngte chu tihchhiat a ni ang; Nu chu a fate nên paih sawmin an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangni Bethel mite u, In sual nasa tak avângin Chûng thil chu in chungah a lo thleng dâwn. Israel lal pawh khawfîng chah hmain a boral ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel hnam chu a naupan lai ata tawh ka hmangaih a, Aigupta ram ata ka fapa atân ka ko chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Koh an nihin an hla sauh va, Baal-ho hnênah an inthawi zâwk ṭhîn a, Milem siam chawpte hnênah rimtui an hâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan Ephraim chu bâna dawmin kal ka zirtîr a, Anmahni ka tihtîr a ni tih erawh chu an hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring hruihrual, hmangaihna hruite chuan anmahni ka kai a, An tân chuan an khabea kawl hlihsaktute ang chu ka ni. Duat takin an hmaah ei tûr ka hlui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta ramah ka tîr leh tawh lo vang a; Mahse, an inlamlêt duh loh avângin, Assuria chu an lal a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A khawpuiahte chuan khandaih a invilik ang a, A kulhte chu a tiboral ang a, A tiral ang, anmahni thu lo râwn avâng ngeiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite chuan mi hawisan an tum reng a. An nghâwngkawl rit tak avângin Chungnungbera an au vang a; Mahse, tu mân an chawi kânsak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Ephraim, engtin nge ka thlauhthlâk theih ang che? Aw Israel, engtin nge ka thlah theih ang che? Engtin nge Adma angin ka siam theih ang che? Engtin nge Zeboiim angin ka awmtîr theih ang che? Ka chhûngah ka thinlung a inlumlet a, Ka khawngaihnate chu a inchhêm vâm ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thinrimna nasa tak chu ka hlen lo vang a, Ephraima chu tihboral ka tin leh tawh lo vang. Kei chu mihring ni lovin Pathian ka ni si a, Nangmaha awm Mi Thianghlima chu; Khawpui chu ka rawn luhkhung lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chu an zui ang a, Sakeibaknei anga rûm ngei tûra chu. A ni, a rûm ngei ang a; Tin, khawthlang lam aṭangin a fate chu An lo tlân dual dual ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta aṭang chuan chawngzawng angin, Assuria aṭang chuan ṭhûro angin, thla zâp siau siauvin an lo kal ang. Tin, an in lum ka luahtîr ang,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraima chuan dâwt thuin mi hual a, Israel chhûngte chuan bumnain; Mahse, Juda chuan Pathian thu a âwih a, Mi Thianghlima lakah a rinawm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraima chuan thli rinrâwlah a neih a, Khawchhak thli chu a zui ṭhîn a; Dâwt thu leh ṭiavaina thu a tipung tial tial a, Assuria nên thu an thlung a, Aigupta lamah hriak a phur lût a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Juda chungah pawh lungawi lohna tûr a nei bawk a, Jakoba chu a awm dân angzia zêlin a hrem ang a; A thiltih angzia zêlin a thungrûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhûlah pawh khân a unaupa chu a keartuiah a rawn man a, A lo puitlinin Pathian a bei a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni, vântirhkoh a bei a, a hneh ta a; A ṭap a, duhsakna a ngên a. Bethel hmunah chuan amah a hmu ta a, Tah chuan ka hnênah thu a sawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa ngei, Sipaihote Pathian chu. Lalpa tih chu a chhinchhiahna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, nang chuan i Pathian hnên lam hawi la; Khawngaihna leh rorêlna hmang la, I Pathianah chuan innghat fo rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kanaan-ho angin Israel chuan bûkna dik lo a lek a; Bum mawlh a châk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraima chuan, “Ka hausa tak zet ta mai, Ka intimuk tak meuh ta a ni; Ka hnathawh zawng zawngahte lah chuan, Keimahah khawlohna thil sual an hmuh tûr a awm miah lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, kei hi Aigupta ram aṭang tawh khân, Lalpa i Pathian chu ka ni a; Kût hun lai ang khân puan inah ka la chêntîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zâwlneite hnênah pawh thu ka sawi ṭhîn a, Inlârnate ka tipung a; Zâwlneite hmangin ka vau lâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead chu khawlohna a ni lo vem ni? Eng mah lo mai an ni alâwm; Gilgal-ah chuan sebâwngpa an hlân ṭhîn a; A ni, an maichâmte chu leileh rih khawh thlûra Lung theh khâwm ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jakoba chu Aram ramah a tlân bo va; Israela chuan nupui man a tuak a, Nupui man atân chuan berâm a vêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zâwlnei hmangin Israela chu Aigupta ram aṭangin Lalpan a hruai chhuak a, Zâwlnei vêk hmang chuan a humhim bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephraima lah chuan a tithinrim nasa êm êm mai a; Chuvângin, a thisen chhuah chu ama chungah a tla a, A sawichhiatna chu ama chungah Lalpan a tlâktîr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ephraiman thu a sawi chuan khurhna khawp a tling hial ṭhîn, Israel mite zîngah ngaih ropui a ni miau va; Baala hnêna a tlûk chinah erawh chuan a thi ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûnah te hian an sual zual ta deuh deuh va, An tangkaruain milim chhûn an insiam chawp a, Anmahni ngaih dân angzia zêla milim chu; Chûng zawng zawng chu themthiamte kutchhuak a ni chungin, “Inthawina hlântu apiangte chuan Bâwngnote chu fâwp rawh se!” an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, zîng ṭiauchhûm ang leh, Dai hma taka bo leh mai ṭhîn ang te, Hruiha buhsî, ṭhâwngaleivirin a lâk bo ang te, Meikhu chhuahnaa meikhu ang te an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei erawh hi chu Aigupta ram aṭang tawha Lalpa i Pathian chu ka ni a; Kei tih loh chu Pathian dang i hre ngai lo va, Kei lo hi chu chhandamtu dang an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlalêr ram ro nasa taka kâwm ṭhîntu che kha ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ei tûr dawnah chuan an tlai a; An tlai chu an thinlungin a chapo phah a; Tichuan, min theihnghilh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, an tân sakeibaknei ang ka ni a, Keitê angin kawng lakah anmahni ka châng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Savawmno chân angin anmahni ka bei ang a, An lung tuamtute ka hai thlêr vek ang a, Chumi hmunah chuan sakeibaknei angin Anmahni ka ei zo vang; Ramsate chuan an phih darh zo dâwn a nih chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel, nangmah puitu mi do hi i chhiatna a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I khawpui zawng zawnga chhanhim theitu tûr che I lal chu tûnah khawiah nge a awm le? “Lal leh hotute mi pe rawh,” i tihate, I rorêltute chu khawiah nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thinrimin lal ka pe che a, Ka thinurin ka la bo leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ephraima khawlohna chu khâwl khâwm a ni a, A sualna chu chhêk khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hmeichhe nau vei lungngaihna ang chu a chungah a lo thleng ang: Amah chu fapa fing lo tak a ni e, A hun takah nau lo chhuahna hmunah a awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Seol kut ata anni chu ka tlan ang em ni? Thihna ata ka chhan chhuak dâwn em ni? Aw thihna, i hripuite chu khawiah nge? Aw Seol, i tihchhiatna chu khawiah nge? Ka khawngaih dâwn hauh lo, Sim mah se, ka bengkhawn lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A unaute zînga a hmuingîl ber ni mah se, Khawchhak thli a lo thawk ang a, Thlalêr aṭanga Lalpa thaw ngei chu a lo kal mêk a ni; A tuihna te chu a kang ang a, A tuikhur te chu a ro zo vang; Bungbêl ṭha zawng zawng, a ro chu a tichhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samaria a ṭiau vang, A Pathian chungah a hel si a; Khandaiha tihtlûkin an awm ang a, An nausênte chu paih sawm an ni ang a, An hmeichhia, nau pai laite chu tai thlêr an ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Israel, Lalpa i Pathian lamah chuan kîr leh rawh, I khawlohna avâng ngeiin i tlûk tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu keng chungin Lalpa lamah kîr leh la, A hnênah chuan heti hian sawi rawh: “Khawlohna zawng zawng chu la bo la, A ṭha apiang chu pawm ang che; Tichuan, kan hmui rahte chu Bâwngpa aiah kan rawn hlân ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Assuria chuan min chhandam lo vang a, Sakawr chungahte kan chuang lo vang; Kan kutchhuakte hnênah chuan, ‘Kan pathiante in ni e,’ kan ti tawh hek lo vang, Fahrahte chuan nangmahah Khawngaihna an hmu ṭhîn si a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“An hnungtawlhna hi ka tidam ang a, An lak aṭanga ka thinrimna chu a kian tâk avângin, Anni chu ka hmangaih hrim hrim dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel lakah chuan daifîm ang ka ni ang a; Ani chu lili angin a lo vul ang a, Lebanon tlâng thing zung angin a zung a thlâk darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zârte chu a ṭawi luih ang a; A mawizia chu olive thing ang mai a ni ang a, Lebanon sidar angin a rimtui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hlima chêngte chu an lo kîr ang a; Buh angin an nung thar ang a, Grêp hrui angin an lo duah ang. Lebanon uain angin an hming a thang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ephraima chuan milemte nên inzâwlna eng nge a neih tawh ang? Kei hi a ṭawngṭaina chhângtu ka ni a, A tung dingtu pawh ka ni; Kei chu fâr thing hring dup ang ka ni a, I rah ṭhate chu keima laka mi a ni e.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu nge finga hêng hi hre thiam thei ang? Tu nge fingvâra hre thei ang? Lalpa kawngte chu a dik a, Mi dikte chuan an zawh dâwn si a; Bawhchhetute erawh chu chutah chuan An inchhuih thlu dâwn a ni.
  </para>
</usx>
